[6–8 s] Scene 4 – The Kraken Appears
WS — Kraken glides from darkness, eyes gentle.
Motion/FX: bioluminescent wave pattern rippling over tentacles.
Audio: deep hum + synth chord bloom.

[8–10 s] Scene 5 – The Touch
CU — one tentacle brushes her cheek; no fear, only calm.
Motion/FX: slow motion particles, refraction shimmer.
Audio: faint chime + warm resonance.

[10–12 s] Scene 6 – The Embrace
WS — both figures entwined in currents of light, sea and sky blending.
Motion/FX: radiating concentric ripples; crossfade back to her sleeping face.
Audio: melody peak + soft vocal hum.

[12–15 s] Scene 7 – The Return
CU — back in the real world, her hair still slightly wet, eyes half-open.
Motion/FX: single drop falls from her hair; fades to white.
Audio: silence, then faint wave loop → seamless restart.
